[{"client_msg_id":"2ad22e7f-4cad-4f24-bb28-64247e469ba7","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"おじいちゃんがお年で5〜7年くらい前に閉店しちゃったんですよ...\nその後、いまだに台湾茶店難民になってしまっています。\n高くて美味しい茶屋はあるんですけど、安くてそこそこうまい茶屋を発掘できてなくて悲しいです。\n\n当時でも激安だった覚えがあり、これをみても40g 1200円だとお手頃な範囲だと思うので、ぜひぜひお試しを！","ts":"1630239327.115600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UAI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9acd696-cfff-4e47-b966-d396bd924086","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"三本商事、今も営業しているかよくわからない。","ts":"1630239051.111900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dx24r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CF44FC78-D91B-4186-8DC9-3D955C855D16","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"10年ほど前に黄茶を買った時の写真がありました。","ts":"1630238915.111100","files":[{"id":"F02DDR9UW64","created":1630238912,"timestamp":1630238912,"name":"iOS の画像.jpg","title":"iOS の画像","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U843L486L","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":49685,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02DDR9UW64/ios__________.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02DDR9UW64/download/ios__________.jpg","original_h":450,"original_w":600,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02DDR9UW64-0935d3872c/ios___________64.jpg","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02DDR9UW64-0935d3872c/ios___________80.jpg","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02DDR9UW64-0935d3872c/ios___________160.jpg","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02DDR9UW64-0935d3872c/ios___________360.jpg","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":360,"thumb_360_h":270,"thumb_480":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02DDR9UW64-0935d387