7-93e6a18e49e1","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"これでもかなり安い方だと思いますが、中華街のはさらにお安めなんですね。行きたいなぁ。\n横浜は遠くなりにけり。","ts":"1630238498.108800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wNn2M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E7121446-C70B-45CC-9079-74FA6AC7FF8B","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"おっ霍山黄芽。楽天でも取り扱い数少ないんですね。いつも中華街のヨボヨボの爺ちゃんがやっていた店で気軽に買っていたので、こんな価格になっているとは...\n\n私も久々に好きだった黄茶、君山銀針を買ってみよう。","ts":"1630238204.107000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O16F5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9df28e16-072f-4448-a3c7-42597bfd0e39","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"まだ黄茶は飲んだことないです。\n楽天でも手の出せそうなのが一応見つかった。 \u003chttps://item.rakuten.co.jp/tian-xiang/fup002/\u003e","ts":"1630237719.102500","attachments":[{"fallback":"楽天市場: 【楽天市場】霍山黄芽 40g：天香茶行","id":1,"title":"【楽天市場】霍山黄芽 40g：天香茶行","title_link":"https://item.rakuten.co.jp/tian-xiang/fup002/","text":"悶黄という工程を経た黄茶。飲みやすい緑茶の感。。霍山黄芽 40g","thumb_url":"https://shop.r10s.jp/tian-xiang/cabinet/cabinet/images/imgrc0090108115.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"楽天市場","service_icon":"https://item.rakuten.co.jp/favicon.ico","thumb_width":1000,"thumb_height":1000,"from_url":"https://item.rakuten.co.jp/tian-xiang/fup002/","original_url":"https://item.rakuten.co.jp/tian-xiang/fup002/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ari","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YqHJs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2A89F0A3-89C8-4815-8611-68EC60B0CD69","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"焙煎していない緑茶より薄いから私も最初は良さがわかるまで時間がかかりました。半発酵している(だったような)黄茶もお勧めなんですけど、生産している絶対量が少ないですがもしよければ試してみてください！","ts":"1630237393.101900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zx39"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28e0d9b4-2bd9-473e-80c9-0b1e9049eb53","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"やはり薄めなんですね。この抽出でこれで正解なんだろうか？　と半信半疑でした。","ts":"1630236665.094300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uEV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1059E9CE-BED2-4D94-AC23-E1169852FA75","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"おぉっ白茶。台湾の白毫銀針を好きでよく飲んでました。抽出は薄めで爽やかな風味で仕事中に何杯も飲み進められんですよね。","ts":"1630236573.093700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QJ7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8fecbf8-4e30-4cf3-a71c-6b1ebe879fe8","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"これはとても丁寧な仕事","ts":"1630235288.089100","edited":{"user":"U01HFNMNB55","ts":"1630235301.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X6wkt"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"スクショ漁ってたら出てきました\nいつかに作ったガレットです","ts":"1630232666.088100","files":[{"id":"F02D2NX11CH","created":1630232639,"timestamp":1630232639,"name":"IMG_20200420_124547.jpg","title":"IMG_20200420_124547.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":3175714,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02D2NX11CH/img_20200420_124547.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02D2NX11CH/download/img_20200420_124547.jpg","original_h":2448,"original_w":3264,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02D2NX11CH-f2da21322f/img_20200420_124547_64.jpg","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02D2NX11CH-f2da21322f/img_20200420_124547_80.jpg","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02D2NX11CH-f2da21322f/img_20200420_124547_160.jpg","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02D2NX11CH-f2da21322f/img_20200420_124547_360.jpg","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":360,"thumb_360_h":270